 {
  "section": "Store settings — labor rates & money",
  "key": "T",
  "title": "A customer approved a line at $500 and the app later re-figured it to $600",
  "sub": "A line does not remember the rate it was agreed at, so a rate change can move a price the customer already said yes to.",
  "dims": [
   "Reliability High",
   "Size L",
   "Codex 4+",
   "Touches data: new stored information on every approved line, plus a one-time cleanup you run",
   "Population: every approved line, every rate change"
  ],
  "pop": "Any customer whose approved price is re-figured after the store changes its rate — and whoever has to explain it.",
  "styles": [],
  "blocks": [
   "<figure class=\"viz\">\n        <figcaption class=\"viz-cap\"><span>Why the guards keep failing</span></figcaption>\n        <ol class=\"story\">\n          <li>\n            <span class=\"stephead\"><span class=\"n\">1</span>\n              <svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M8.4 12.3l2.4 2.4 4.8-5\"/></svg>\n            </span>\n            <p>The customer <b>approves at $500</b>.</p>\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            <span class=\"stephead\"><span class=\"n\">2</span>\n              <svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5v19\"/><path d=\"M17 6.5H9.8a3.3 3.3 0 0 0 0 6.6h4.4a3.3 3.3 0 0 1 0 6.6H6.5\"/></svg>\n            </span>\n            <p>The store <b>changes its rate</b>.</p>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"bad\">\n            <span class=\"stephead\"><span class=\"n\">3</span>\n              <svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 2.5 20h19L12 3z\"/><path d=\"M12 9.5v4.5M12 17h.01\"/></svg>\n            </span>\n            <p><b>Today:</b> five separate &ldquo;don&rsquo;t touch&rdquo; rules stand guard. One missed &rarr; <b>$600</b>.</p>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"good\">\n            <span class=\"stephead\"><span class=\"n\">4</span>\n              <svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 22s7-4.2 7-10V5.6L12 3 5 5.6V12c0 5.8 7 10 7 10z\"/><path d=\"M9.2 12.2l2 2 3.6-3.8\"/></svg>\n            </span>\n            <p><b>Proposed:</b> the line carries its own rate &mdash; nothing to guard.</p>\n          </li>\n        </ol>\n        <div class=\"viz-foot\">Scenario: the store raises its labor rate; a line the customer already approved gets re-figured at the new rate by some path nobody remembered to special-case.</div>\n      </figure>"
  ],
