   "<figure class=\"viz\">\n        <figcaption class=\"viz-cap\"><span>Seven small calls</span><span class=\"hint\">scroll &rarr;</span></figcaption>\n        <div class=\"scroller\">\n          <table class=\"plain\">\n            <thead>\n              <tr><th scope=\"col\">Loose end</th><th scope=\"col\">Recommendation</th></tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n              <tr>\n                <td class=\"surface-name\">Staff opening the raw customer link is recorded as &ldquo;Customer moved this RO to Customer Viewed&rdquo; &mdash; fix how staff previews are detected.</td>\n                <td><span class=\"gate good\">fix</span></td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td class=\"surface-name\">The &ldquo;moved&rdquo; toast also fires on the admin list / pipeline drag where the change is already visible.</td>\n                <td><span class=\"gate warn\">keep (harmless)</span></td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td class=\"surface-name\">Off-roster movers (platform owner cross-org, DMS import) read &ldquo;A teammate&rdquo;.</td>\n                <td><span class=\"gate warn\">leave</span></td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td class=\"surface-name\">&ldquo;Paste image&rdquo; right-click item exists only on the parts line card; Ctrl/Cmd+V and drop work everywhere on desktop &mdash; extend the menu item to the RO page tab / MPI / scan?</td>\n                <td><span class=\"gate warn\">later</span></td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td class=\"surface-name\">New-RO &ldquo;Scan paper RO&rdquo; accepts paste but has no drop target.</td>\n                <td><span class=\"gate warn\">later</span></td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td class=\"surface-name\">Cart-rail 44&times;30 preview and post-capture routing review get no photo card (deliberate).</td>\n                <td><span class=\"gate warn\">leave</span></td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td class=\"surface-name\">Hybrid touch+trackpad laptops untested for the MPI photo tap gate.</td>\n                <td><span class=\"gate good\">check once</span></td>\n              </tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n      </figure>"
  ],
  "questions": [
